  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Welcome to \"Casa Del Sol,\" a beautifully decorated and comfortable 3-bedroom, 2.5-bathroom home located in the picturesque Inlet Beach. The open floor plan creates a welcoming atmosphere for spending quality time together. The spacious living and dining areas provide ample room for relaxation, while the well-equipped kitchen boasts granite countertops, stainless steel appliances, and a wide variety of cooking utensils and small appliances. Step outside the kitchen to a generous patio and outdoor shower area, perfect for rinsing off after a day at the beach. A convenient half bath is also located on the first floor. Upstairs, you'll discover three bedrooms and two bathrooms. The master bedroom features a king bed and a large shower in the en-suite bathroom. The second bedroom offers a king bed, while the third bedroom is designed with two sets of twin-over-twin bunks and a twin trundle. These two bedrooms share a bathroom equipped with a tub/shower combo.<br><br>Grande Pointe at Inlet Beach is an exclusive coastal community nestled alongside Camp Helen State Park and overlooking Lake Powell. Situated on over 30 acres, this beautiful neighborhood seamlessly integrates upscale homes with the surrounding natural environment, preserving native foliage and large trees. The result is a charming and private waterfront village set in a lush, natural setting. A lakefront pavilion serves as a perfect gathering spot for special events, and nature paths lead to Lake Powell, the community dock, and the swimming pool.<br><br>HELPFUL NEIGHBORHOOD INFORMATION:<br>- This home is located just 1 block from the Grande Pointe Community Pool.<br><br>TRANSPORTATION:<br>- A golf cart is not provided with this rental; however, you can rent one from a preferred partner.<br><br>\"CASA DEL SOL\" BED CONFIGURATIONS: (Sleeps 9)<br>- Master Suite, Second Floor: King Bed, Private Bathroom with Walk-in Shower<br>- Bedroom 2, Second Floor: King Bed, Shared Bathroom with Tub/Shower Combo<br>- Bedroom 3, Second Floor: 2 Sets of Twin-Over-Twin Bunks with a Twin Trundle, Shared Bathroom with Tub/Shower Combo<br><br>FEATURES:<br>- 3 Bedrooms / 2.5 Bathrooms, Sleeps 9<br>- Located in the Grande Pointe Neighborhood in Inlet Beach<br>- Community Pool<br>- Community Grilling Area<br>- Fully Appointed Kitchen<br>- Full-Size Refrigerator with Ice Maker<br>- Granite Countertops<br>- Complimentary Wireless Internet<br>- Full-Size Washer & Dryer<br>- Off-Street Parking",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "\"Casa Del Sol\" at Grande Pointe Inlet Beach - 3 BR/2 BA - Sleeps 9"
        }
      ],
